source 2003 Stam "On Montgomery-like representations for elliptic curves over GF(2^k)", Section 3.2, plus a1 = 1, plus b8 = a6, plus a6 = sqrta6^2, plus common-subexpression elimination
parameter sqrta6
assume sqrta6^2 = a6
compute XX1 = X1^2
compute ZZ1 = Z1^2
compute X3 = (XX1+sqrta6*ZZ1)^2
compute Z3 = XX1*ZZ1
